WEBVTT

00:16.120 --> 00:23.460
We sigh whenever we're about to come to a standstill

00:16.120 --> 00:23.460
Owarinaki tabi no tochuu tachidomarisouna toki

00:23.460 --> 00:29.710
While moving on this endless journey.

00:23.460 --> 00:29.710
Fukai tameiki kobosu bokura wa

00:31.800 --> 00:37.430
Everytime we lunge for it, it escapes and flies off.

00:31.800 --> 00:37.430
Tsukamikaketewa mata hanareteitta

00:37.890 --> 00:44.850
But now, there's nothing to be afraid of

00:37.890 --> 00:44.850
Demo ima wa mou nanimo osoreru koto wa nai

00:45.480 --> 00:52.780
The powerful ties that bind our hearts

00:45.480 --> 00:52.780
Kokoro wo tsunagu tsuyoi kizuna wa

00:52.780 --> 00:58.240
Will never come loose.

00:52.780 --> 00:58.240
Keshite hodoke wa shinai sa

01:00.280 --> 01:07.960
After a lifetime of searching, we finally arrived

01:00.280 --> 01:07.960
Sagashitsuzukete tadoritsuita

01:07.960 --> 01:13.760
Here, where the period lies.

01:07.960 --> 01:13.760
Kono basho de piriodo ni

01:14.920 --> 01:23.060
Let's change all our sorrow and rage to power.

01:14.920 --> 01:23.060
Kanashimi ikari chikara ni kaete

01:23.060 --> 01:27.980
Destiny is right within our reach.

01:23.060 --> 01:27.980
Unmei wa sugu soba ni

01:38.490 --> 01:39.700
Dear!

01:39.700 --> 01:41.240
Stay back!

01:41.450 --> 01:42.700
Hey...

01:43.120 --> 01:46.000
I think you owe me an explanation, Wrath...!

01:46.000 --> 01:48.000
My past memories won't disappear...

01:48.870 --> 01:53.250
They're making so much noise inside my head!!

01:54.300 --> 01:55.710
Why are you...

01:56.260 --> 01:59.010
Why is King Bradley inside of my memories?!

02:00.590 --> 02:01.760
You!!

02:01.760 --> 02:04.220
What did you do to my belongings?!

02:07.180 --> 02:08.730
This is your greed, huh...

02:09.190 --> 02:13.360
You're a fool who craves even his past,
without knowing how to let anything go!

02:15.690 --> 02:16.820
Damn you!

03:03.280 --> 03:04.320
Master!

03:04.870 --> 03:07.490
Madam, Sir Selim, are you two all right as well?!

03:07.490 --> 03:08.870
Y-Yes...

03:09.500 --> 03:10.750
We're terribly sorry.

03:10.960 --> 03:13.420
The guards didn't even stand a chance against him...

03:13.420 --> 03:15.420
No, worry not.

03:15.420 --> 03:17.550
He was quite powerful.

03:17.550 --> 03:18.510
Yes, sir...

03:30.770 --> 03:32.020
Father,

03:32.690 --> 03:33.980
hurry up and retire.

03:36.650 --> 03:37.860
Olivier...

03:38.480 --> 03:42.650
You come home after such a long time,
and that's the first thing you have to say?

03:43.280 --> 03:48.490
I'm asking you to spend the remainder of your life in peace after naming me the head of the family.

03:48.950 --> 03:52.370
I plan to have Alex succeed the house.

03:52.540 --> 03:54.750
A coward like him?

03:55.250 --> 04:00.380
Why not transfer all of the family property and go on a long vacation to a foreign country or something?

04:00.880 --> 04:05.590
Alex would be nothing but a hindrance to the Armstrong name.

04:10.470 --> 04:11.640
Sister!

04:11.640 --> 04:13.850
So you were home.

04:13.850 --> 04:16.190
Great timing, Alex.

04:16.190 --> 04:16.900
Father?

04:17.060 --> 04:18.900
Duel with Olivier.

04:18.900 --> 04:20.190
Pardon?

04:20.190 --> 04:22.690
The victor shall inherit the house.

04:23.110 --> 04:25.570
How does that sound, Olivier?

04:25.570 --> 04:26.620
Perfect.

04:26.620 --> 04:27.910
A plausible solution.

04:29.160 --> 04:33.460
Olivier told me to retire and to leave the country.

04:33.460 --> 04:34.710
What?!

04:35.830 --> 04:39.540
What an insult to our father!

04:40.090 --> 04:41.960
Very well!

04:47.050 --> 04:52.060
I shall show you what my muscles are capable of.

04:53.850 --> 04:55.690
Quite brave of you, Alex!

04:55.690 --> 04:58.060
You'll soon see how inexperienced you truly are!

04:59.690 --> 05:01.610
Well then, shall we get going?

05:01.820 --> 05:02.990
Yes.

05:06.530 --> 05:10.080
So, where should we go for vacation?

05:10.080 --> 05:12.790
How about Xing, Dear?

05:12.790 --> 05:15.710
I hear the food is wonderful there.

05:15.710 --> 05:17.580
Very well, Xing it is.

05:17.580 --> 05:19.250
Are you okay with that, Catherine?

05:19.250 --> 05:21.040
Yes, Father.

05:31.010 --> 05:32.260
W-Wait...

05:32.260 --> 05:34.020
You wish.

05:34.020 --> 05:35.890
Are you planning on killing me...?

05:35.890 --> 05:37.310
It took you this  long to notice?!

05:38.730 --> 05:40.520
Good luck, Brother!

05:42.860 --> 05:45.570
What should we get for them as souvenirs?

05:45.570 --> 05:47.450
What about an elephant?

05:47.450 --> 05:49.320
They're big and strong.

05:49.320 --> 05:51.490
Wow, I'd like one too!

05:59.000 --> 06:01.880
No!!!

06:08.090 --> 06:09.510
It would appear the outcome has been decided.

06:16.560 --> 06:20.400
I'm going to inherit everything
owned by the Armstrong family.

06:21.520 --> 06:22.810
Sister...

06:22.810 --> 06:26.820
I hear you've been quite familiar with the upper echelon lately.

06:26.990 --> 06:28.320
Why?!

06:28.320 --> 06:29.700
Do you not know what they're-

06:29.700 --> 06:32.450
I plan to see things with my own eyes before making a decision.

06:32.870 --> 06:34.620
So after you saw their true intentions,

06:34.700 --> 06:39.120
you had the family flee the country in order to keep them safe?

06:42.330 --> 06:43.840
The defeated should disappear.

06:43.840 --> 06:45.800
This mansion belongs to me now.

07:10.110 --> 07:12.450
Where are you headed, little girl?

07:13.620 --> 07:15.870
This is the easternmost town.

07:15.870 --> 07:18.120
Even if you keep going, you'll only find a desert.

07:18.370 --> 07:21.960
Umm... I was planning on going back to my country.

07:21.960 --> 07:22.830
Your country?

07:22.830 --> 07:24.540
Yes. To Xing.

07:24.540 --> 07:26.250
You're going to cross the desert?

07:26.250 --> 07:27.170
Yes.

07:27.550 --> 07:30.470
A little girl like you is going to cross the desert by herself?

07:30.470 --> 07:31.470
Yes.

07:34.140 --> 07:35.390
Hey guys!

07:35.600 --> 07:36.760
Let's get something together!

07:36.760 --> 07:38.560
Bring out some food and the like!

07:38.560 --> 07:40.350
Huh? But...!

07:40.350 --> 07:41.810
Don't be so restrained!

07:41.810 --> 07:45.060
Why not stay here for the night
and leave for your trip tomorrow?

07:45.060 --> 07:47.070
You can use our bath.

07:47.070 --> 07:48.650
Are you hungry?

07:49.230 --> 07:52.280
Oh yeah, Steve, you've got an extra room at your place, right?

07:52.280 --> 07:53.240
Why don't you let her stay there?

07:53.240 --> 07:54.570
Sure, fine with me.

07:54.570 --> 07:57.080
My eldest daughter's room is open right now.

07:57.080 --> 07:59.700
Emmy, who left for the university in Central, right?

07:59.700 --> 08:02.540
She's too perfect to be your daughter.

08:02.540 --> 08:03.750
Can't argue with that.

08:04.420 --> 08:07.000
We also need to feed this little kitty something.

08:08.380 --> 08:10.550
Oh, my! You must be really hungry!

08:10.550 --> 08:12.920
Are you sure it's not just looking at you  as its next meal?

08:12.920 --> 08:14.340
Don't be stupid!

08:14.840 --> 08:17.010
That's not true, right, Kitty?

08:18.220 --> 08:19.930
See? It's saying that you look tasty!

08:24.390 --> 08:25.850
Nice people, aren't they?

08:27.110 --> 08:28.320
Are you just going to abandon them?

08:28.980 --> 08:31.440
Well, I guess that's fine.

08:31.860 --> 08:38.870
But I don't think you'll gain anything from
bringing back a half-dead homunculus like me.

08:40.580 --> 08:46.170
However, if you go to Central, you'll be able to learn the true method to gain immortality.

08:46.670 --> 08:49.250
You may be able to save these people as well.

08:50.750 --> 08:52.130
Oh well.

08:52.130 --> 08:56.340
I guess it doesn't mean much to you,
since you're on your way back to your country.

09:05.600 --> 09:08.440
Thank you so much for your kindness, everyone!

09:09.020 --> 09:10.360
Where are you going?!

09:10.360 --> 09:12.230
I still have something I need to take care of!

09:12.230 --> 09:14.150
I'm going back to Central!

09:15.820 --> 09:17.030
What a moron.

09:17.030 --> 09:20.200
If you go back to Central, the cards will be in my favor.

09:21.370 --> 09:25.290
As long as I obtain a philosopher's stone, I can return to my original form.

09:25.960 --> 09:27.290
As long as I obtain one...

09:47.520 --> 09:48.690
What is this place?

09:48.690 --> 09:51.310
It's a hideout we've used before.

09:51.900 --> 09:54.030
So this is where your little brother is?

09:54.030 --> 09:54.990
Yeah.

09:54.990 --> 09:57.360
One hundred percent positive.

09:57.360 --> 09:59.320
Al will definitely be here!

10:00.200 --> 10:01.320
Hey!

10:01.320 --> 10:02.950
There's no one here!

10:01.320 --> 10:02.160
Ow!

10:03.120 --> 10:05.080
You're such an unreliable brother!

10:05.580 --> 10:08.750
So we came all the way down here for nothing?

10:28.060 --> 10:29.140
Lin.

10:29.140 --> 10:30.480
No... is it Greed?

10:33.150 --> 10:35.730
I'm... starving...

10:36.030 --> 10:37.940
Okay, it's Lin.

10:47.750 --> 10:49.460
Much better!

10:49.460 --> 10:51.460
Thanks for the meal!

10:51.460 --> 10:54.130
You always eat so much, doofus!

10:54.130 --> 10:56.500
So much for our emergency provisions.

10:56.500 --> 10:58.510
Who are those two? Your friends?

10:58.510 --> 10:59.340
Meet Donkey Kong and Li-

10:59.340 --> 11:00.260
My name's Darius!

11:00.260 --> 11:01.590
I'm Heinkel.

11:02.050 --> 11:06.260
We used to be in the army, but we're working with this brat right now for various reasons.

11:06.640 --> 11:08.220
Who the hell is he?

11:08.220 --> 11:11.940
Well... how should I explain it...

11:11.940 --> 11:13.480
I'm a homunculus.

11:13.480 --> 11:14.520
Homun-

11:14.520 --> 11:16.520
Hey, hey! Why can't you keep your mouth shut?!

11:16.520 --> 11:17.480
Seriously?!

11:17.480 --> 11:19.780
It's a long story, but...

11:19.780 --> 11:22.740
Hang on, what the hell are you doing here, anyway?

11:23.320 --> 11:26.790
Greed cut all ties with the other homunculi.

11:27.330 --> 11:31.500
I took advantage of his restlessness at that point to get my body back from him.

11:32.420 --> 11:35.920
I was looking for a place near Central where I could rest,

11:35.920 --> 11:37.130
and I found this shed...

11:38.340 --> 11:39.340
What's wrong?!

11:39.590 --> 11:40.630
This isn't good!

11:41.050 --> 11:42.510
Greed's trying to take over!

11:43.050 --> 11:44.010
Hey!

11:44.010 --> 11:45.930
Hey! Hey! Wait just a second!

11:45.930 --> 11:47.260
Hold out! Don't lose!

11:47.260 --> 11:48.770
Keep your senses!

11:49.560 --> 11:51.560
Listen up, Ed!

11:52.270 --> 11:59.900
That 'Father' guy who lurks beneath Central is going to open the gate on "The Day".

12:00.610 --> 12:02.450
I can only speculate since I'm an amateur at this sort of thing,

12:02.860 --> 12:08.160
but wouldn't you and Al be able to get your bodies back if you two leap into that gate?

12:09.410 --> 12:11.370
No, wait.

12:11.370 --> 12:13.420
That may be true,

12:13.670 --> 12:16.500
but you need to pay a toll to open the gate...

12:18.130 --> 12:21.670
What the hell is he opening the gate for?

12:22.260 --> 12:26.680
Since you said "The Day", does he already know when he's going to open it?

12:26.680 --> 12:27.800
That's...

12:28.180 --> 12:29.310
Lin!

12:29.310 --> 12:30.220
Hey!

12:30.970 --> 12:31.890
Dammit...

12:32.930 --> 12:34.440
Don't take over just yet...!

12:36.060 --> 12:37.310
The message...

12:37.980 --> 12:41.990
Did you deliver my message... to Lan Fan?

12:41.990 --> 12:43.030
"Message"?

12:46.570 --> 12:47.950
Al delivered it to her.

12:47.950 --> 12:49.200
Lan Fan is fine.

12:49.580 --> 12:51.620
I don't know where she is now, though.

12:51.620 --> 12:54.500
Wow, I'm glad to hear...

12:55.500 --> 12:56.290
Lin!

12:56.790 --> 12:58.080
Sorry...

12:58.710 --> 13:01.050
Can't hold out any... longer.

13:07.840 --> 13:10.560
Damn that prince!

13:11.100 --> 13:13.310
Blabbering on and on...!

13:13.310 --> 13:14.480
Is that you, Greed?

13:14.480 --> 13:16.390
Yeah, it's me.

13:17.440 --> 13:18.650
I wouldn't do that if I were you.

13:19.060 --> 13:21.020
You can't kill me with that.

13:22.530 --> 13:23.900
Sorry to disturb you guys.

13:25.150 --> 13:25.700
Hey!

13:25.990 --> 13:28.110
Are you just going to let us go?!

13:28.320 --> 13:29.490
What?

13:30.410 --> 13:33.240
Weren't you listening to what this guy was saying?

13:33.240 --> 13:35.540
I cut ties with the homunculi.

13:35.870 --> 13:40.250
I lost it and attacked Bradley.

13:40.250 --> 13:43.340
I don't know what  they'll do to me if I go back.

13:43.340 --> 13:47.010
That's why I'm just going to run off
like this and live an easy life.

13:47.340 --> 13:48.380
Alone.

13:49.970 --> 13:51.350
Want to join us?

13:54.970 --> 13:57.770
If you've got nowhere else to go, then come with us.

14:05.780 --> 14:07.360
Join you...

14:07.360 --> 14:09.360
Join you, eh?

14:09.360 --> 14:10.870
That's funny.

14:11.450 --> 14:12.740
Cut the shit!

14:12.740 --> 14:15.500
This entire world belongs to me!

14:15.500 --> 14:20.540
If you  want to work under me , I just might consider it!

14:22.170 --> 14:23.290
Later.

14:33.510 --> 14:34.810
Comrades, huh...

14:35.720 --> 14:40.100
I've got so many souls inside of me...

14:40.650 --> 14:43.190
And yet, I'm... alone.

14:43.190 --> 14:45.860
Then why don't you join up with Ed and them?

14:47.360 --> 14:50.780
If you don't like that, then give me back my body.

14:51.200 --> 14:55.370
I'll become the Emperor of Xing and fill up the emptiness in your soul.

14:55.990 --> 14:57.700
An emperor of a country, eh...

14:58.120 --> 14:59.330
Big dream, huh?

14:59.790 --> 15:00.870
You brat!

15:00.870 --> 15:02.130
That's way too small.

15:03.330 --> 15:05.000
If you're going to go that way...

15:06.250 --> 15:10.010
Why don't you strive to become the King of the world?

15:11.050 --> 15:12.640
King of the world...

15:12.640 --> 15:13.760
Hey, Lin!

15:13.760 --> 15:14.550
Wait up!

15:15.970 --> 15:18.020
What? You guys are so persistent!

15:18.220 --> 15:19.980
I told you, I'm Greed!

15:19.980 --> 15:23.020
I don't even care which one you are anymore!

15:23.020 --> 15:23.900
Just to make it easier, I'll call you Gredlin!

15:23.900 --> 15:24.730
Hey! Who are you calling Gredl-

15:24.730 --> 15:27.400
I'll work under you, Gredlin.

15:27.940 --> 15:28.820
What?

15:29.400 --> 15:32.660
I told you, I'll work for you.

15:32.660 --> 15:37.290
Which means these two chimeras working with me will be working for you as well.

15:37.290 --> 15:38.410
What?!

15:38.410 --> 15:39.620
You brat!

15:39.620 --> 15:41.080
Who gave you permission, anyway?!

15:41.080 --> 15:42.250
Don't get so cocky, you runt!

15:42.920 --> 15:44.170
Midget! Flea!

15:48.340 --> 15:55.510
Besides, the moment I decided to become a dog of the military, I threw away all my pride.

15:55.760 --> 15:58.680
At this point, I don't really care if I have to wag my tail.

15:58.680 --> 15:59.770
And besides,

16:00.020 --> 16:04.520
it would be dumb to lose this opportunity to get information by having my pride take over.

16:04.940 --> 16:07.150
The chance of a lifetime!

16:08.610 --> 16:10.360
How foolish.

16:10.360 --> 16:14.410
You're going to let your strong feelings take over like that and lose important information?

16:18.160 --> 16:19.620
Interesting!

16:19.620 --> 16:22.370
Becoming one of my men also means becoming an outcast!

16:22.370 --> 16:23.750
You better not regret it!

16:23.750 --> 16:25.040
Don't take me lightly!

16:25.040 --> 16:28.130
I've done far worse than this!

16:28.340 --> 16:30.000
What the hell?

16:30.000 --> 16:31.760
Then it's decided.

16:31.760 --> 16:33.880
Then you two are my men as well.

16:33.880 --> 16:36.090
Yeah, sure, whatever.

16:36.090 --> 16:38.760
I don't care who I follow as long as I get to eat.

16:38.760 --> 16:41.020
Just out of curiosity, what kind of chimeras are you?

16:41.020 --> 16:42.100
I'm a gorilla.

16:42.100 --> 16:42.640
Lion here.

16:43.890 --> 16:45.350
That's pretty sweet.

16:45.350 --> 16:48.400
I still have her earrings...

16:49.110 --> 16:53.400
Looks like I won't be seeing Winry and Al for a while...

16:54.780 --> 16:57.530
"The Day"... huh.

17:02.160 --> 17:05.330
Seriously, stop coming here all the time!

17:04.440 --> 17:08.180
Dublith

17:04.460 --> 17:08.170
Dublith

17:05.330 --> 17:08.250
I even said I'd let you know when Miss Izumi returns!

17:08.840 --> 17:11.960
If you keep visiting like this, we'll go out of business!

17:15.630 --> 17:17.390
Curtis butcher shop, how can I help you?

17:17.890 --> 17:19.510
Oh, we're always glad to have your business, sir!

17:19.510 --> 17:20.890
The one you ordered, right?

17:21.140 --> 17:22.430
We'll be back.

17:22.430 --> 17:24.980
Come back as a customer for once, will ya?!

17:27.310 --> 17:30.730
I'm sorry, the soldiers were here again.

17:31.320 --> 17:32.110
Yes.

17:32.900 --> 17:36.610
I have a message for you from Alphonse and a man named Hohenheim.

17:38.850 --> 17:42.740
Outskirts of North City

17:38.870 --> 17:42.740
Outskirts of North City

17:38.950 --> 17:40.070
I see.

17:41.200 --> 17:43.750
That sounds like a pretty big deal.

17:45.200 --> 17:46.080
Yeah.

17:46.080 --> 17:47.080
Got it.

17:49.670 --> 17:51.340
The promised day, huh...

17:53.050 --> 17:56.920
Briggs Mountains

17:53.050 --> 17:56.920
Briggs Mountains

18:00.340 --> 18:02.220
Hurry and contact headquarters!

18:02.220 --> 18:03.770
This is Point Papa!

18:03.770 --> 18:04.970
We're under attack!

18:04.970 --> 18:06.600
What?! Drachman forces?!

18:06.600 --> 18:07.600
I don't know!

18:07.600 --> 18:08.940
How many men?!

18:08.940 --> 18:09.850
Just one!

18:09.850 --> 18:11.900
One?! Who are they?!

18:14.150 --> 18:15.940
Hey! I'm asking who they are!

18:16.690 --> 18:17.950
Point Papa!

18:17.950 --> 18:18.860
Who is the enemy?!

18:19.450 --> 18:20.410
A housewife!

18:21.530 --> 18:25.370
Briggs Fortress

18:21.530 --> 18:25.370
Briggs Fortress

18:22.080 --> 18:25.450
Frontier troops randomly assaulted by a mysterious woman?

18:26.080 --> 18:28.960
This is just like what happened around twenty years ago.

18:28.960 --> 18:31.210
They were all beat down by one force?

18:31.380 --> 18:34.880
They're really going to get killed by the Major General when she returns.

18:36.460 --> 18:37.550
Major Miles!

18:37.630 --> 18:40.550
Briggs Fortress Prison

18:37.630 --> 18:40.550
Briggs Fortress Prison

18:38.420 --> 18:39.510
Good work.

18:41.010 --> 18:44.060
An Ishbalan with dark glasses,

18:44.060 --> 18:46.390
and a large man with a mohawk.

18:46.390 --> 18:48.560
Just like I heard.

18:49.230 --> 18:51.810
I was waiting for you two to come out.

18:53.060 --> 18:54.650
Who the hell are you?

18:54.650 --> 18:58.150
Like I said, I'm a passing housewife.

18:58.150 --> 19:00.740
I have a message for you from Al.

19:02.410 --> 19:03.740
Can we speak in private?

19:04.280 --> 19:07.790
Yes, it's a message from Alphonse Elric.

19:04.870 --> 19:07.790
Outskirts of North City

19:04.870 --> 19:07.790
Outskirts of North City

19:08.500 --> 19:10.540
All that was contained in the message is "The Promised Day".

19:10.540 --> 19:13.210
Well, well, the promised day.

19:10.620 --> 19:14.500
East City: Grumman's Residence

19:10.620 --> 19:14.500
East City: Grumman's Residence

19:13.210 --> 19:14.920
Very fitting.

19:15.420 --> 19:17.880
Things are really starting to get interesting.

19:20.470 --> 19:22.890
Eastern Headquarters: Firing Range

19:20.470 --> 19:22.890
Eastern Headquarters: Firing Range

19:24.220 --> 19:26.220
Hey, Rebecca!

19:26.220 --> 19:27.600
Your skills are as good as ever!

19:27.600 --> 19:28.520
And...

19:28.520 --> 19:29.520
Your butt is as sexy as ever!

19:30.980 --> 19:33.690
What are you doing, Lieutenant General Grumman?!

19:34.690 --> 19:37.110
You shouldn't let your guard down on the battlefield.

19:37.400 --> 19:41.110
By the way, you're friends with Lieutenant Hawkeye, right?

19:43.200 --> 19:45.990
Central

19:43.200 --> 19:45.990
Central

19:45.990 --> 19:47.910
Hey, Riza!

19:48.120 --> 19:50.290
It's been so long, Rebecca!

19:51.660 --> 19:56.670
They rescheduled the joint training between the north and the east.

19:56.670 --> 20:00.800
You know, because of that battle between Drachma and Briggs from the other day.

20:01.130 --> 20:04.430
Now it's planned to take place in the east, right?

20:04.680 --> 20:06.720
I heard from the Führer President.

20:06.720 --> 20:11.430
First, Colonel Mustang, now, the Führer President...

20:11.680 --> 20:15.560
Introduce me to some hot guys in Central, why don't you?

20:15.560 --> 20:17.480
Here's one.

20:18.400 --> 20:19.610
Hayate!

20:19.610 --> 20:22.150
Your master is heartless! She's stingy!

20:25.160 --> 20:27.070
You just watch!

20:27.070 --> 20:30.290
I'm going to marry some rich guy and retire already!

20:30.290 --> 20:32.750
Okay! Good luck!

20:32.750 --> 20:34.040
Oh.

20:34.290 --> 20:37.040
Give my regards to Second Lieutenant Havoc.

20:37.040 --> 20:38.290
Sure.

20:38.460 --> 20:39.630
See you later!

20:47.640 --> 20:51.220
"Give my regards to Second Lieutenant Havoc", huh?

20:53.180 --> 20:58.400
I'm thinking about transferring to a hospital in the east once my body settles down.

20:58.400 --> 20:59.360
Is that so?

20:59.360 --> 21:00.980
It'll get lonely around here.

21:01.570 --> 21:04.740
If I had known that, I would have brought you something better.

21:04.950 --> 21:06.200
This is for you.

21:06.200 --> 21:07.780
One cigarette a day, right?

21:07.780 --> 21:09.330
Thanks a bunch!

21:09.330 --> 21:10.830
I just ran out of them.

21:11.120 --> 21:12.750
Well, I'll visit you again.

21:12.750 --> 21:13.960
Thanks!

21:13.960 --> 21:14.830
Oh, right.

21:15.330 --> 21:17.460
Rebecca was worried about you.

21:17.460 --> 21:18.830
Okie dokie!

21:20.920 --> 21:23.170
If the Colonel visits, please give him my regards.

21:23.170 --> 21:24.550
Sure thing!

21:25.930 --> 21:28.050
Did you hear that, Colonel?

21:30.350 --> 21:32.930
You didn't need to hide like that.

21:32.930 --> 21:35.560
Well, we're both being watched.

21:35.980 --> 21:39.560
It'll be bad if they get suspicious of us after meeting in private.

21:43.570 --> 21:44.940
Delicious...

21:45.530 --> 21:47.740
How about a smoke, Colonel?

21:47.740 --> 21:49.620
No, I'll pass.

21:49.620 --> 21:51.830
Come on, just one for the road.

22:02.840 --> 22:05.130
"In the following Spring,

22:06.420 --> 22:08.180
on the promised day,

22:09.260 --> 22:11.850
both the north and the east will make their move."

22:25.820 --> 22:30.820
The promise we never made

22:25.820 --> 22:30.820
Kawashita hazu no nai yakasoku ga

22:30.820 --> 22:31.570
yet again

22:30.820 --> 22:31.570
Kyou mo

22:31.570 --> 22:36.450
tries to snatch our future away from us.

22:31.570 --> 22:36.450
Bokura no mirai wo ubaou to suru

22:37.870 --> 22:41.830
Why is it that we can't rejoice

22:37.870 --> 22:41.830
Hoshigatteita mono wo te ni shitemo

22:41.830 --> 22:43.040
straight from the heart

22:41.830 --> 22:43.040
Sunao ni

22:43.040 --> 22:48.010
when we obtain something we've always been after?

22:43.040 --> 22:48.010
Umaku waraenai nowa nazedarou

22:48.510 --> 22:53.680
The overflowing tears aren't from feebleness or remorse.

22:48.510 --> 22:53.680
Afureru namida wo yowasa ya koukai ja nai

22:54.140 --> 22:58.430
They're fragments born from agony.

22:54.140 --> 22:58.430
Itami ga unda kakera de

23:00.100 --> 23:03.560
Of all the moments and destinies,

23:00.100 --> 23:03.560
Donna shunkan datte unmei datte

23:03.560 --> 23:12.240
I realized there's one absolute certainty.

23:03.560 --> 23:12.240
Hitotsu dake tashika na mono ga aru to shitta

23:12.240 --> 23:14.870
Even if things get tough and I'm at my limit

23:12.240 --> 23:14.870
Genkai datte konnan datte

23:14.870 --> 23:18.870
I refuse to give up.

23:14.870 --> 23:18.870
Akirametakunaiyo

23:18.870 --> 23:23.630
Please, don't let go.

23:18.870 --> 23:23.630
Konomama hanasanaide

23:23.630 --> 23:31.760
I can feel the warmth of your right hand

23:23.630 --> 23:31.760
Kataku nigirishimeta kimi no migite no nukumori

23:31.760 --> 23:35.260
where it's tightly joined with my left.

23:31.760 --> 23:35.260
Koko ni arukara

23:54.050 --> 23:57.100
The Promised Day

23:58.830 --> 24:02.710
In the Spring of next year, the people harden their resolve.

24:03.120 --> 24:07.460
The boy heads for the enemy's lair with determination in his heart.

24:09.340 --> 24:13.630
Next time, Fullmetal Alchemist:

24:13.630 --> 24:17.660
Episode 46, Looming Shadows.

24:13.660 --> 24:17.660
Looming Shadows

24:18.390 --> 24:21.980
Even if they're far apart, their hearts are linked.

24:22.810 --> 24:25.350
As long as they're both on the move.
